# A local Playwright config, for running the e2e suite against a browser that
# is already on the machine instead of one `playwright install` fetched. It
# pins an absolute executablePath, so it is true for exactly one machine and
# would break `npm run test:e2e` for everyone else if it were committed.
playwright.local.config.ts

# Claude Code. The skills and the shared project config are committed — they're
# part of how this repo is worked on. `settings.local.json` stays out: it's the
# per-machine half, full of absolute paths true for exactly one computer.
.claude/settings.local.json


